  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A particle is moved along a path <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo></math> as shown in figure, in presence of a force <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> are in meter and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></math> The work done on the particle by this force <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> will be ____ Joule.<br ><img src=\"assets\\qt0004_eba70d04c4f1.png\"/></p>"
